WEBVTT

01:12.900 --> 01:18.620
[Meet Yourself]

01:18.980 --> 01:24.260
[Episode 33]

01:25.439 --> 01:27.759
[Live in Abundance]

01:31.719 --> 01:33.719
You also learned to cook.

01:34.759 --> 01:37.559
When you come to see me on holiday,
cook for me.

01:39.239 --> 01:40.999
Who told you that I'm not picky?

01:40.999 --> 01:42.359
I'm very picky.

01:43.799 --> 01:44.359
I don't care.

01:44.359 --> 01:45.359
You have to cook.

01:46.399 --> 01:48.599
Then if you don't cook for me,
don't come to see me.

01:50.359 --> 01:51.359
Huang.

01:51.759 --> 01:52.799
Uncle Deqing.

01:53.039 --> 01:53.759
I got things to do.

01:53.759 --> 01:54.759
Bye.

01:56.919 --> 01:57.598
Uncle.

01:57.599 --> 01:59.799
I was looking for you today
to talk about the old house.

01:59.799 --> 02:00.558
Huang.

02:00.559 --> 02:02.439
I'm here to talk to you about the old house.

02:02.959 --> 02:04.359
I thought it over.

02:04.639 --> 02:08.679
Compared with those developed places,
the situation here is still different.

02:08.959 --> 02:10.718
I shouldn't have high expectations for rent.

02:10.719 --> 02:11.678
Yes.

02:11.679 --> 02:13.199
You see, when you first came here,

02:13.199 --> 02:15.438
I thought that a little girl
can't make a difference.

02:15.439 --> 02:16.799
But now,

02:17.039 --> 02:20.279
everyone in the village
all became your minions.

02:20.559 --> 02:21.999
Minions...

02:22.999 --> 02:24.958
What a unique way of complimenting!

02:24.959 --> 02:26.278
You're young but ambitious.

02:26.279 --> 02:27.159
I can see everything.

02:27.159 --> 02:28.279
You're a good official.

02:28.839 --> 02:30.638
Well, this matter.

02:30.639 --> 02:32.039
It's all your call.

02:32.279 --> 02:33.838
The rent, you negotiate it.

02:33.839 --> 02:35.838
You decide how much the rent should be.

02:35.839 --> 02:37.478
I trust you completely.

02:37.479 --> 02:39.759
I just want to
make a little contribution to the village.

02:39.759 --> 02:41.119
Wait, Uncle.

02:41.479 --> 02:44.038
This old house belongs
to Grandpa Yang.

02:44.039 --> 02:46.758
The contract also needs to
be signed by Grandpa Yang.

02:46.759 --> 02:48.399
It's invalid for us to make an agreement.

02:48.919 --> 02:49.838
Huang.

02:49.839 --> 02:51.038
You go talk about the rent.

02:51.039 --> 02:52.438
I'll deal with my father.

02:52.439 --> 02:53.438
No.

02:53.439 --> 02:54.839
After you persuade your father,

02:54.839 --> 02:56.598
I can go talk about the rent.

02:56.599 --> 02:58.959
Otherwise,
if Grandpa Yang doesn't agree to sign,

02:58.959 --> 03:00.359
my work would be in vain.

03:00.359 --> 03:01.558
I might as well go get the land license.

03:01.559 --> 03:02.198
No land license.

03:02.199 --> 03:03.199
No need for that.

03:03.639 --> 03:04.839
I'll go to my father first.

03:05.719 --> 03:06.719
Alright.

03:06.919 --> 03:09.759
Then this task,
I'll count it on you.

03:09.759 --> 03:10.759
Alright.

03:11.359 --> 03:14.358
Don't apply for the land license
while I'm persuading.

03:14.359 --> 03:15.119
Prepare for both.

03:15.119 --> 03:16.518
Neither way will be delayed.

03:16.519 --> 03:18.358
No need for preparation.

03:18.359 --> 03:20.599
If you apply for the land,
villagers also have opinions.

03:20.919 --> 03:21.439
Rest assured.

03:21.439 --> 03:22.079
No big problem.

03:22.079 --> 03:23.079
I'll go first.

03:25.519 --> 03:26.879
Uncle Deqing.

03:28.119 --> 03:29.119
Come on.

03:30.119 --> 03:31.718
It's all in my hands.

03:31.719 --> 03:32.799
In your hands.

03:34.639 --> 03:35.719
Take care.

03:43.919 --> 03:44.999
Hello, Xie.

03:45.839 --> 03:46.918
Let me tell you.

03:46.919 --> 03:48.718
Uncle Deqing is worried.

03:48.719 --> 03:50.439
He came to the village committee to see me.

03:50.799 --> 03:51.999
Really.

03:52.479 --> 03:54.519
I think there's hope for this.

04:37.399 --> 04:38.399
Exercising?

04:39.959 --> 04:41.119
Go to kindergarten?

04:54.639 --> 04:56.559
♫ You draw the sun ♫

04:56.559 --> 04:59.198
♫ I draw the national flag ♫

04:59.199 --> 05:01.839
♫ Motherland ♫

05:01.839 --> 05:04.518
♫ We love you ♫

05:04.519 --> 05:06.879
♫ Motherland ♫

05:06.879 --> 05:09.519
♫ We love you ♫

05:13.879 --> 05:15.239
Great!

05:15.599 --> 05:17.838
Kids, you sang very well.

05:17.839 --> 05:19.999
During the showtime,
don't be nervous, kids.

05:19.999 --> 05:21.758
Just sing it normally.

05:21.759 --> 05:23.479
I still want to thank Mr. Hu today

05:23.479 --> 05:25.038
to come and practice with us.

05:25.039 --> 05:26.519
Let's thank Mr. Hu together.

05:26.519 --> 05:31.359
Thank you, Mr. Hu.

05:31.359 --> 05:32.518
You're welcome.

05:32.519 --> 05:33.759
Good singing.

05:35.119 --> 05:37.478
Mr. Hu.

05:37.479 --> 05:38.399
What's wrong, Hulu?

05:38.399 --> 05:38.919
Mind the steps.

05:38.919 --> 05:39.919
Mind the steps

05:40.159 --> 05:41.279
What's the matter?

05:41.839 --> 05:42.519
Mr. Hu.

05:42.519 --> 05:44.199
Do I sing well?

05:44.719 --> 05:45.798
Sure.

05:45.799 --> 05:48.119
Can I stand in the middle then?

05:49.999 --> 05:51.159
Hulu.

05:51.399 --> 05:52.559
Here's the thing.

05:52.879 --> 05:53.719
Standing in the middle

05:53.719 --> 05:56.078
isn't always the most important and best.

05:56.079 --> 05:58.038
In the chorus,
everyone is very important.

05:58.039 --> 05:59.759
Don't just think about expressing yourself.

06:00.599 --> 06:03.638
When I go to primary school,
I won't stand in the middle.

06:03.639 --> 06:05.679
I can stand in the back.

06:05.919 --> 06:06.919
Why?

06:07.239 --> 06:10.238
When performing,
grandparents are coming to see me.

06:10.239 --> 06:14.558
If I don't behave well,
they'd blame my mom.

06:14.559 --> 06:16.119
Blame your mom.

06:17.239 --> 06:19.719
Grandparents think that
the school here is not good.

06:19.719 --> 06:22.038
They want me to go to Kunming for school.

06:22.039 --> 06:23.519
I have to be good in every aspect.

06:23.519 --> 06:25.239
Only if I stand in the middle,
my mom can

06:25.239 --> 06:27.559
keep me at home for school.

06:29.199 --> 06:30.959
Is this what your mom told you?

06:31.159 --> 06:35.239
When mom and dad made a call,
I overheard that.

06:41.199 --> 06:42.559
Mr. Hu.

06:42.559 --> 06:44.479
Help me.

06:46.799 --> 06:48.078
Luo Xiaoqiao.

06:48.079 --> 06:49.199
Why are you here?

06:49.199 --> 06:50.519
Class begins.

06:51.559 --> 06:53.039
Well, you go to class first.

06:53.039 --> 06:53.879
Let's talk about it later.

06:53.879 --> 06:54.959
What are you gripping Mr. Hu?

06:54.959 --> 06:56.199
Let's go to class.

06:57.239 --> 06:58.239
Goodbye, Mr. Hu.

06:58.239 --> 06:59.239
Bye.

06:59.359 --> 06:59.639
Let's go.

06:59.639 --> 07:00.639
Listen carefully in class.

07:39.119 --> 07:40.038
Nana.

07:40.039 --> 07:41.039
Coffee.

07:41.519 --> 07:42.439
Okay, Mr. Hu.

07:42.439 --> 07:43.679
Wait a minute.

07:44.239 --> 07:45.078
Mr. Hu.

07:45.079 --> 07:46.519
Last night,
I went to the bar with friends to see you.

07:46.519 --> 07:47.799
But you didn't go to work.

07:48.359 --> 07:50.039
Yesterday, I rested.

07:50.359 --> 07:51.519
Then we'll go again tonight.

07:51.519 --> 07:52.158
Are you there?

07:52.159 --> 07:52.958
Yes, I am.

07:52.959 --> 07:54.518
When you go, I'll buy you a drink.

07:54.519 --> 07:54.919
Great.

07:54.919 --> 07:55.998
It's a deal.

07:55.999 --> 07:56.999
Love you.

08:02.519 --> 08:03.598
Nana.

08:03.599 --> 08:05.759
There are many guests today.

08:08.639 --> 08:09.719
Where's Xiaochun?

08:11.599 --> 08:13.879
She seems to be busy in the warehouse.

08:15.959 --> 08:19.399
These days,
are there a lot of people in the town?

08:20.039 --> 08:21.319
It seems to be.

08:22.519 --> 08:24.678
I think, it's because

08:24.679 --> 08:28.438
the video of the tourism blogger
in the WeChat group has gone viral.

08:28.439 --> 08:30.359
When people watch the video,
they would like to

08:30.359 --> 08:31.838
travel here and take a look.

08:31.839 --> 08:33.039
Do you think so?

08:33.399 --> 08:35.039
It should be.

08:37.759 --> 08:41.079
Why are you so indifferent to me?

08:41.079 --> 08:41.919
Tell me.

08:41.919 --> 08:43.519
Chat with me.

08:52.239 --> 08:54.079
Fresh cold brew tea.

08:54.879 --> 08:55.919
My treat.

08:59.079 --> 09:01.519
Why do you still treat me so badly?

09:02.239 --> 09:03.239
Hu.

09:04.119 --> 09:06.398
Don't you see that I'm busy?

09:06.399 --> 09:08.959
If you want to chat,
go to Manjun.

09:08.959 --> 09:11.078
Aren't you two in love?

09:11.079 --> 09:12.479
We...

09:13.039 --> 09:14.838
We're not in love.

09:14.839 --> 09:16.079
We...

09:16.079 --> 09:17.799
So you two are kidding?

09:19.239 --> 09:20.359
No.

09:20.959 --> 09:22.239
We were on the other side of the wall.

09:22.239 --> 09:25.039
You completely didn't
treat us as outsiders.

09:29.799 --> 09:30.798
Work hard.

09:30.799 --> 09:32.278
Cheer up.

09:32.279 --> 09:33.359
No, you work.

09:33.359 --> 09:34.999
You... Cup.

09:36.079 --> 09:37.839
Work hard.

09:49.839 --> 09:52.159
[Xiaochun]

09:56.759 --> 09:58.759
[Xiaochun, I want to rest for a few months.]

09:58.759 --> 10:00.599
[And return to visit my parents in Shanghai.]

10:10.479 --> 10:11.958
The color is really beautiful.

10:11.959 --> 10:13.319
I want to dye a skirt.

10:13.559 --> 10:14.278
Okay.

10:14.279 --> 10:15.238
I'll dye it for you.

10:15.239 --> 10:15.839
Dye more.

10:15.839 --> 10:16.879
So you can change.

10:17.439 --> 10:20.358
I think the staff clothes of the
guesthouse can use tie-dye.

10:20.359 --> 10:21.078
How about it?

10:21.079 --> 10:21.918
No problem.

10:21.919 --> 10:23.039
I'll find someone to make them for you.

10:25.039 --> 10:26.039
Xiaochun.

10:26.559 --> 10:27.838
Qin, come to play?

10:27.839 --> 10:28.438
Candy.

10:28.439 --> 10:29.439
Candy.

10:30.439 --> 10:31.479
Uncle Yao.

10:32.199 --> 10:33.478
Hongdou, you are also here.

10:33.479 --> 10:34.719
I'm here to help.

10:34.999 --> 10:35.838
Uncle Yao.

10:35.839 --> 10:37.878
Why is Luo Li the Hiker so powerful?

10:37.879 --> 10:39.198
I heard Yang Zhinan said

10:39.199 --> 10:41.638
the guesthouses in the town
were all booked up at the weekend.

10:41.639 --> 10:43.998
And people keep calling to make reservations.

10:43.999 --> 10:45.839
The weekend is also booked up?

10:46.239 --> 10:47.678
Not only is his guesthouse fully booked.

10:47.679 --> 10:49.838
Another one in town,
which used to be 120 yuan a night,

10:49.839 --> 10:52.158
changed the price to 220 yuan.

10:52.159 --> 10:53.678
But it's also full.

10:53.679 --> 10:55.759
Are we going to be popular here?

10:56.279 --> 10:56.839
Uncle Yao.

10:56.839 --> 10:58.279
What do you want me to do?

10:58.879 --> 11:00.758
Hang up these.

11:00.759 --> 11:01.759
Okay.

11:04.079 --> 11:06.439
These days,
there are obviously more tourists.

11:06.999 --> 11:08.998
But on weekends,
all guesthouses in the town

11:08.999 --> 11:10.319
are fully booked.

11:10.639 --> 11:11.359
Besides,

11:11.359 --> 11:14.559
there are self-driving guests
from surrounding cities.

11:14.999 --> 11:18.519
Today,
we need to discuss an emergency plan

11:18.759 --> 11:21.279
to get through this weekend
with the largest tourist flow.

11:21.479 --> 11:23.798
to avoid tourists flooding in here

11:23.799 --> 11:25.599
but can't dine well and play well,

11:25.599 --> 11:27.198
and go back with a lot of anger.

11:27.199 --> 11:28.798
The village also held a meeting
in the afternoon.

11:28.799 --> 11:30.359
Where Luo Li has been in the video

11:30.359 --> 11:32.918
must be special spots
for tourists to visit then.

11:32.919 --> 11:34.278
So let's highlight them.

11:34.279 --> 11:36.358
For meal,
Galsang Flower Restaurant.

11:36.359 --> 11:37.239
Be sure to notify them,

11:37.239 --> 11:39.238
prepare more ingredients and vegetables.

11:39.239 --> 11:41.038
Hire more temporary helpers.

11:41.039 --> 11:41.799
The woodcarving workshop.

11:41.799 --> 11:42.359
The cafe.

11:42.359 --> 11:42.879
The tie-dye workshop.

11:42.879 --> 11:43.999
And the embroidery workshop.

11:43.999 --> 11:45.238
Staff should also be enough there.

11:45.239 --> 11:46.638
The materials should be prepared
as soon as possible.

11:46.639 --> 11:47.879
How much is enough?

11:48.479 --> 11:50.359
Huang will make statistics tomorrow

11:50.359 --> 11:53.798
of tourist numbers in the ancient city
and several popular towns in recent years.

11:53.799 --> 11:57.239
And the reservation of the guesthouse
in the town and village.

11:57.239 --> 12:00.439
We can have a preliminary estimate
of the tourist flow.

12:00.839 --> 12:01.839
Got it.

12:02.079 --> 12:03.399
Actually, I'm mainly worried that

12:03.399 --> 12:05.679
our infrastructure's
reception capacity is limited.

12:05.999 --> 12:06.878
Yes.

12:06.879 --> 12:10.758
When the infrastructure
can't carry the customer flow,

12:10.759 --> 12:12.558
the service staff would never be enough.

12:12.559 --> 12:15.119
We really can't stand in
our own shoes and think that

12:15.119 --> 12:16.679
others should be considerate of us.

12:16.679 --> 12:18.759
Instead,
we should really stand in the customer's position

12:18.759 --> 12:20.239
to solve problems for them.

12:20.479 --> 12:23.359
How should we think
from the perspective of guests?

12:23.719 --> 12:25.279
They hope to be seen.

12:25.599 --> 12:27.038
Difficulties can be solved.

12:27.039 --> 12:28.078
Be respected.

12:28.079 --> 12:29.319
Be valued.

12:29.759 --> 12:31.119
What should we do?

12:31.999 --> 12:34.239
Mr. Xie and I will
discuss a plan later.

12:34.719 --> 12:36.678
It may need a lot of people.

12:36.679 --> 12:39.158
See who's not busy then in the village.

12:39.159 --> 12:40.598
Ask them to come and help.

12:40.599 --> 12:41.078
Okay.

12:41.079 --> 12:42.518
I'm on it.

12:42.519 --> 12:44.919
Who's free in the village,
I know best.

12:45.199 --> 12:46.199
Okay.

12:48.199 --> 12:49.319
Xiaochun.

12:49.839 --> 12:51.879
The vacation I've mentioned...

12:52.799 --> 12:54.959
Can you take a rest after this weekend?

12:55.479 --> 12:57.518
We need helpers right now.

12:57.519 --> 13:00.039
Then,
Hongdou and others will all come to help.

13:02.999 --> 13:03.639
But I...

13:03.639 --> 13:04.598
What?

13:04.599 --> 13:05.959
Is it your parents' birthday?

13:08.039 --> 13:09.559
Isn't your parents' birthday in February?

13:09.559 --> 13:10.559
Right?

13:15.359 --> 13:17.359
I'll give you a holiday next week.

13:19.239 --> 13:21.199
What are you acting like we're in a crisis?

13:21.199 --> 13:22.558
Isn't that a good thing?

13:22.559 --> 13:24.118
We've been doing this for so long.

13:24.119 --> 13:25.159
Isn't it just for today?

13:25.159 --> 13:26.038
Right?

13:26.039 --> 13:28.079
If we want to catch the gift of fate,

13:28.079 --> 13:30.519
we have to bear the weight.

13:30.839 --> 13:31.239
Comrades.

13:31.239 --> 13:31.998
Cheer up.

13:31.999 --> 13:32.918
Come on.

13:32.919 --> 13:33.798
Let's cheer up.

13:33.799 --> 13:34.799
Go.

13:38.479 --> 13:39.479
1 2 3

13:39.479 --> 13:40.559
Come on!

13:41.559 --> 13:44.079
♫ Mushrooms can fill the basket ♫

13:44.079 --> 13:46.759
♫ I take out a pen ♫

13:46.759 --> 13:49.998
♫ The pen leaks ink ♫

13:49.999 --> 13:52.918
♫ What can I do ♫

13:52.919 --> 13:57.319
♫ I have piles of mung beans ♫

13:58.759 --> 13:59.878
Go ahead.

13:59.879 --> 14:00.559
Yeah.

14:00.559 --> 14:01.398
Go ahead.

14:01.399 --> 14:02.479
Come with me.

14:03.399 --> 14:04.759
Drive forward.

14:06.839 --> 14:09.718
♫ Tender gingers taste pungent ♫

14:09.719 --> 14:12.479
♫ They pile up like a tower ♫

14:12.679 --> 14:15.518
♫ And the tower is tall ♫

14:15.519 --> 14:18.358
♫ With a slim figure ♫

14:18.359 --> 14:20.439
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep ♫

14:26.679 --> 14:29.518
♫ And the tower is tall ♫

14:29.519 --> 14:32.358
♫ With a slim figure ♫

14:32.359 --> 14:34.439
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep ♫

14:35.919 --> 14:36.999
Your skin is so fair.

14:36.999 --> 14:37.918
And you're so thin.

14:37.919 --> 14:39.918
This light blue one
is suitable for you.

14:39.919 --> 14:41.759
I think it's really beautiful.

14:42.119 --> 14:43.838
Can I have a discount?

14:43.839 --> 14:44.918
10% off for two.

14:44.919 --> 14:45.919
20% off three.

14:45.919 --> 14:46.839
20% off at most.

14:46.839 --> 14:47.879
Excuse me.

14:47.879 --> 14:48.679
Hello.

14:48.679 --> 14:50.118
Help yourself first.

14:50.119 --> 14:50.878
Hello.

14:50.879 --> 14:51.879
I'm Candy.

14:51.879 --> 14:53.358
Hello, Candy.

14:53.359 --> 14:55.039
How much is this?

14:56.439 --> 14:58.398
Eighty-six yuan.

14:58.399 --> 14:59.478
Sorry.

14:59.479 --> 15:00.878
No sorry.

15:00.879 --> 15:02.438
Eighty-six.

15:02.439 --> 15:03.278
Money.

15:03.279 --> 15:04.279
Money.

15:04.439 --> 15:05.359
Eighty-six.

15:05.359 --> 15:06.359
Yeah.

15:06.759 --> 15:07.959
10% off for two.

15:07.959 --> 15:09.719
20% off for three.

15:09.919 --> 15:10.998
Sorry?

15:10.999 --> 15:12.039
You don't have to say sorry to me.

15:12.039 --> 15:13.599
Why do you always say sorry?

15:14.479 --> 15:15.479
Sister.

15:15.719 --> 15:16.799
Come here.

15:17.679 --> 15:19.919
Tell her that 10% off for two.

15:19.919 --> 15:20.998
20% off for three.

15:20.999 --> 15:24.279
She means if you buy two pieces of clothes,
you can get a 10% discount.

15:24.279 --> 15:25.839
If you buy three pieces of clothes...

15:25.839 --> 15:27.078
Candy.

15:27.079 --> 15:28.799
May I try this?

15:28.799 --> 15:29.518
Sure.

15:29.519 --> 15:30.638
I'll take you to the fitting room.

15:30.639 --> 15:31.639
Go.

15:31.759 --> 15:34.398
♫ Gingers are tender ♫

15:34.399 --> 15:37.278
♫ Tender gingers taste pungent ♫

15:37.279 --> 15:40.039
♫ They pile up like a tower ♫

15:40.239 --> 15:43.079
♫ And the tower is tall ♫

15:43.759 --> 15:45.039
So handsome.

15:46.399 --> 15:47.238
Xiaxia.

15:47.239 --> 15:48.839
You look just like in the video.

15:48.839 --> 15:50.359
Don't you have a beauty filter?

15:50.759 --> 15:51.359
I don't.

15:51.359 --> 15:52.799
It's a bit scary.

15:52.799 --> 15:53.919
The face would be sharp.

15:54.359 --> 15:55.839
Xiaxia, look at the camera.

15:56.999 --> 15:58.078
Xiaxia.

15:58.079 --> 15:59.199
Do you have a girlfriend?

15:59.399 --> 16:00.238
No.

16:00.239 --> 16:02.959
Do you think I can
be your girlfriend?

16:03.719 --> 16:04.719
No.

16:06.039 --> 16:07.719
Why not?

16:08.239 --> 16:09.398
Where are you from?

16:09.399 --> 16:10.198
Sichuan.

16:10.199 --> 16:11.599
We're college students in Chengdu.

16:11.599 --> 16:13.519
We're all in the same dormitory.

16:13.799 --> 16:15.158
Have you seen giant pandas?

16:15.159 --> 16:16.239
Yes.

16:16.719 --> 16:17.799
So good.

16:18.639 --> 16:20.158
Would you like to come and play with us?

16:20.159 --> 16:22.599
We'll treat you to Chengdu
snacks and the giant panda visit.

16:22.599 --> 16:23.518
Yeah.

16:23.519 --> 16:24.719
Come on, it's fun.

16:24.719 --> 16:25.838
It's really fun.

16:25.839 --> 16:26.359
Super good.

16:26.359 --> 16:26.919
Do you want to go?

16:26.919 --> 16:27.559
I'm not going.

16:27.559 --> 16:28.919
I have to make live streaming.

16:29.239 --> 16:30.879
Fans have ordered a lot of things here.

16:32.599 --> 16:33.479
Your liquor.

16:33.479 --> 16:34.998
Okay, thank you.

16:34.999 --> 16:35.718
You're welcome.

16:35.719 --> 16:36.759
Here comes the braised chicken.

16:36.759 --> 16:37.519
Help me.

16:37.519 --> 16:38.718
Thank you.

16:38.719 --> 16:39.919
Enjoy yourself.

16:40.359 --> 16:41.718
Is our fish ready?

16:41.719 --> 16:42.518
Right away.

16:42.519 --> 16:43.879
Add a serving of fried meat with mint leaves.

16:43.879 --> 16:44.879
Okay.

16:47.519 --> 16:48.359
The fish, hurry up.

16:48.359 --> 16:48.919
Is it ready?

16:48.919 --> 16:50.319
Right away.

17:00.199 --> 17:01.679
Excuse me.

17:03.719 --> 17:04.398
Aunt Hua.

17:04.399 --> 17:05.758
I bring you a box of coke.

17:05.759 --> 17:06.759
Thank you.

17:07.479 --> 17:08.518
Is the fish ready?

17:08.519 --> 17:09.119
Yes.

17:09.119 --> 17:10.119
Here.

17:15.119 --> 17:16.438
Here comes your fish.

17:16.439 --> 17:17.439
Enjoy.

17:18.719 --> 17:19.639
Sorry.

17:19.639 --> 17:20.719
There is not even a place to sit.

17:20.719 --> 17:21.958
Come and drink some water.

17:21.959 --> 17:22.679
Thank you.

17:22.679 --> 17:23.719
Here.

17:23.719 --> 17:24.079
Thank you.

17:24.079 --> 17:24.559
Come on.

17:24.559 --> 17:25.599
This restaurant was recommended by Luo Li.

17:25.599 --> 17:26.118
Thank you.

17:26.119 --> 17:27.119
Thank you.

17:27.279 --> 17:29.919
Did I just see you in the embroidery place?

17:30.399 --> 17:31.358
Yes.

17:31.359 --> 17:32.119
It's time for dinner.

17:32.119 --> 17:33.279
I came to help.

17:34.479 --> 17:35.359
It's mealtime.

17:35.359 --> 17:37.559
You haven't eaten yet
and still queue up here.

17:37.759 --> 17:40.478
Actually, in the village,
there's an old restaurant.

17:40.479 --> 17:41.279
Not far.

17:41.279 --> 17:42.398
The taste is good.

17:42.399 --> 17:44.079
In the town, there are

17:44.079 --> 17:45.838
Mushroom Hot Pot and creative restaurants.

17:45.839 --> 17:46.998
If you want to go there,

17:46.999 --> 17:48.079
there are yellow cars at the intersection.

17:48.079 --> 17:49.558
They can take you there for free.

17:49.559 --> 17:50.799
Let's go to the town to eat hot pot.

17:50.799 --> 17:51.678
Let's go.

17:51.679 --> 17:52.238
Okay.

17:52.239 --> 17:54.439
You tell the uncle of the yellow car
at the intersection that

17:54.439 --> 17:55.519
you'll go to eat Mushroom Hot Pot.

17:55.519 --> 17:56.399
He'll take you there.

17:56.399 --> 17:56.839
Okay, thank you.

17:56.839 --> 17:57.279
Take care.

17:57.279 --> 17:58.358
Bye.

17:58.359 --> 17:59.079
I want to ask you.

17:59.079 --> 18:01.358
Near here,
are there any interesting places?

18:01.359 --> 18:02.199
There are people everywhere.

18:02.199 --> 18:03.199
Too boring.

18:03.199 --> 18:06.199
The places where Luo Li has
been are filled with queues.

18:07.079 --> 18:10.118
Do you like picking and barbecuing?

18:10.119 --> 18:11.518
Nearby, there's a farm.

18:11.519 --> 18:12.478
You can camp at night.

18:12.479 --> 18:13.838
You can see stars.

18:13.839 --> 18:14.839
Where is it?

18:14.919 --> 18:16.038
Not far ahead.

18:16.039 --> 18:16.839
Go up and ask.

18:16.839 --> 18:17.839
And you'd know.

18:17.879 --> 18:19.158
Are you also interested?

18:19.159 --> 18:20.438
Let's go together.

18:20.439 --> 18:20.998
Sure.

18:20.999 --> 18:21.479
Let's go.

18:21.479 --> 18:21.799
Okay.

18:21.799 --> 18:22.438
Thank you.

18:22.439 --> 18:22.918
Thank you.

18:22.919 --> 18:23.919
Take care.

18:33.599 --> 18:34.798
Two cups of Meet.

18:34.799 --> 18:36.159
A boletus pancake.

18:36.999 --> 18:38.038
Xin.

18:38.039 --> 18:38.758
Xin.

18:38.759 --> 18:39.079
Yes.

18:39.079 --> 18:39.959
Pizza for Table Two.

18:39.959 --> 18:40.959
Yeah.

18:47.039 --> 18:48.438
Coffee Latte.

18:48.439 --> 18:49.238
Okay.

18:49.239 --> 18:50.198
Americano.

18:50.199 --> 18:51.359
Americano.

18:53.159 --> 18:54.358
Mango juice.

18:54.359 --> 18:55.519
Mango juice.

19:02.959 --> 19:04.278
Hello, what would you like?

19:04.279 --> 19:05.439
A cup of Peach Tea.

19:05.439 --> 19:07.079
And a cup of Passion Tea.

19:07.479 --> 19:09.559
Why are there queues everywhere?

19:10.719 --> 19:11.839
Wait a minute.

19:12.039 --> 19:15.238
Sorry, Today,
it may take longer if you eat here.

19:15.239 --> 19:17.558
But if you take it out,
there will be a 20% discount.

19:17.559 --> 19:19.359
Besides,
some cafes nearby are also good.

19:19.359 --> 19:20.239
Not far away.

19:20.239 --> 19:21.719
You're in that video, right?

19:21.719 --> 19:22.039
Yeah.

19:22.039 --> 19:23.359
You are the one riding by the sea.

19:23.359 --> 19:23.998
Yeah.

19:23.999 --> 19:24.839
Yes, she's in it.

19:24.839 --> 19:25.919
You have good eyesight.

19:25.919 --> 19:27.598
I just showed up for a while.

19:27.599 --> 19:28.039
The other one.

19:28.039 --> 19:28.999
Is he your boyfriend?

19:28.999 --> 19:29.638
Yes.

19:29.639 --> 19:30.879
You are a good match.

19:30.879 --> 19:31.359
Thank you.

19:31.359 --> 19:32.639
Can we take a picture with you?

19:32.639 --> 19:33.639
Yes.

19:35.359 --> 19:36.759
1 2 3

19:37.239 --> 19:37.999
Thank you.

19:37.999 --> 19:38.879
We'll take it out.

19:38.879 --> 19:39.598
Okay.

19:39.599 --> 19:40.359
This is the menu.

19:40.359 --> 19:41.679
You can have a look.

19:43.199 --> 19:44.399
What about that Granny?

19:44.399 --> 19:45.879
Can we take a photo with her?

19:45.879 --> 19:46.559
Sure.

19:46.559 --> 19:47.159
She's inside.

19:47.159 --> 19:47.759
Please come inside.

19:47.759 --> 19:48.958
Come with me.

19:48.959 --> 19:50.158
Excuse me.

19:50.159 --> 19:51.399
Thank you.

19:56.919 --> 19:58.199
Take a picture for us, thank you.

20:00.599 --> 20:00.999
Come on.

20:00.999 --> 20:01.639
3 2 1

20:01.639 --> 20:03.399
Here. Say cheese.

20:03.399 --> 20:03.879
Okay.

20:03.879 --> 20:05.079
Another one.

20:05.279 --> 20:06.279
Okay.

20:06.439 --> 20:06.679
Okay.

20:06.679 --> 20:07.239
Thank you, Granny.

20:07.239 --> 20:07.639
Thank you.

20:07.639 --> 20:08.438
Look.

20:08.439 --> 20:09.679
Very good.

20:18.359 --> 20:20.439
Dear tourists, follow me.

20:20.439 --> 20:21.519
Don't be left behind.

20:21.519 --> 20:22.519
Follow me.

20:26.999 --> 20:33.438
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

20:33.439 --> 20:40.239
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

20:41.599 --> 20:43.638
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

20:43.639 --> 20:48.079
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

20:48.279 --> 20:55.519
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

20:56.519 --> 20:58.158
Is Granny Caiyun alright?

20:58.159 --> 20:59.639
It's okay. She's just tired.

20:59.639 --> 21:00.239
You think.

21:00.239 --> 21:01.518
During this period,

21:01.519 --> 21:03.638
people took photos with her
from morning to night.

21:03.639 --> 21:04.599
She is old.

21:04.599 --> 21:05.239
She can't take it.

21:05.239 --> 21:06.119
So is Uncle Xiangdong.

21:06.119 --> 21:07.518
He's having acupuncture in the hospital.

21:07.519 --> 21:08.519
Arms.

21:15.039 --> 21:15.999
What's the matter with Nana?

21:15.999 --> 21:17.399
Tired and asleep.

21:23.479 --> 21:25.759
I just come to see you.

21:26.399 --> 21:28.719
From the town's guesthouse reservation,

21:28.719 --> 21:30.719
this flood has passed.

21:31.119 --> 21:33.278
Next weekend,
although there will be many bookings,

21:33.279 --> 21:35.399
but they won't flood in here like this.

21:36.839 --> 21:38.519
If there's another wave,

21:39.039 --> 21:40.279
I would break down, too.

21:40.879 --> 21:42.159
It's hard for you.

21:46.399 --> 21:47.919
Huang is also here.

21:48.479 --> 21:49.439
I'm here to see you.

21:49.439 --> 21:51.239
But,
what's wrong with your voice?

21:51.679 --> 21:53.238
I've been talking all day.

21:53.239 --> 21:55.038
So my voice got hoarse.

21:55.039 --> 21:55.878
No.

21:55.879 --> 21:57.679
What's your smell?

21:58.719 --> 22:00.159
Is there still a smell of garbage?

22:00.519 --> 22:02.319
How much floral water did you spray?

22:02.879 --> 22:04.398
Not much.

22:04.399 --> 22:05.399
That much.

22:08.799 --> 22:09.838
Come here quickly.

22:09.839 --> 22:10.599
Stop talking.

22:10.599 --> 22:11.599
Take a break.

22:12.039 --> 22:13.759
I can help you clean up.

22:13.759 --> 22:14.759
No need.

22:14.759 --> 22:16.279
Your voice became like this.

22:16.479 --> 22:17.479
Drink some water.

22:18.119 --> 22:19.959
You'll all line up to go to the hospital.

22:20.719 --> 22:21.719
Xiaochun.

22:21.919 --> 22:22.679
You also take a rest.

22:22.679 --> 22:23.438
I'm fine.

22:23.439 --> 22:24.439
I'll go.

22:27.879 --> 22:28.879
Xiaochun.

22:29.639 --> 22:32.358
You do not seem very tired.

22:32.359 --> 22:34.599
Go and help Hongdou clean up.

22:36.999 --> 22:38.519
I don't seem tired?

22:38.759 --> 22:40.798
How could you tell
that I'm not very tired?

22:40.799 --> 22:42.119
Go.

22:42.879 --> 22:44.039
Drink water.

22:45.559 --> 22:46.959
I'm not tired.

22:54.039 --> 22:56.119
Xie, you have someone to care for you.

22:59.199 --> 23:00.679
I'm going to take the trumpet tomorrow

23:00.679 --> 23:02.118
and shout in the village.

23:02.119 --> 23:03.479
Let village cadres lead the whole village

23:03.479 --> 23:04.679
to pick up the garbage and clean up.

23:04.679 --> 23:05.679
Are you coming?

23:06.399 --> 23:07.798
Tomorrow morning,

23:07.799 --> 23:09.639
I need to pay the temporary workers' salaries.

23:09.639 --> 23:10.719
I can't go.

23:11.479 --> 23:13.159
Then I won't bother you.

23:18.399 --> 23:19.599
What's the matter?

23:19.599 --> 23:20.719
Had a nightmare?

23:22.399 --> 23:23.559
Look at your sweat.

23:23.559 --> 23:24.279
Drink some water, come on.

23:24.279 --> 23:25.679
Drink some water.

24:27.759 --> 24:29.079
It's quite a thick pile.

24:29.639 --> 24:30.479
Uncle Yao.

24:30.479 --> 24:31.759
I'm here to get my salary.

24:33.119 --> 24:34.319
Hongdou, you're also here.

24:34.679 --> 24:35.119
Here I am.

24:35.119 --> 24:36.119
Daxia.

24:37.079 --> 24:37.799
Qin's salary isn't calculated.

24:37.799 --> 24:39.198
Calculate my Qin's first.

24:39.199 --> 24:40.679
Who is your Qin?

24:40.679 --> 24:43.198
If you want to chase me,
go get the number first and queue.

24:43.199 --> 24:44.358
Don't worry.

24:44.359 --> 24:45.759
I'll go when I'm done.

24:46.039 --> 24:46.878
I'm not in a hurry.

24:46.879 --> 24:48.158
I'm free today.

24:48.159 --> 24:49.758
Is your shop closed today?

24:49.759 --> 24:50.678
No.

24:50.679 --> 24:53.719
Even if I open it,
my father also says I don't do anything.

24:53.999 --> 24:55.959
Qin's salary is one hundred a day.

24:55.959 --> 24:57.759
Plus six hours of overtime pay.

24:57.759 --> 24:59.199
290 yuan in all.

24:59.719 --> 25:01.319
290 yuan.

25:01.639 --> 25:03.319
Give our Qin a round number.

25:03.879 --> 25:04.879
Three hundred.

25:04.919 --> 25:05.799
Uncle Yao.

25:05.799 --> 25:07.279
Why are you so generous?

25:07.279 --> 25:10.118
When you bought bulbs from me,
you had to bargain.

25:10.119 --> 25:12.399
How could a consumer and a boss act the same?

25:12.719 --> 25:13.919
That's a horse of another color.

25:17.639 --> 25:19.238
I might as well work for you.

25:19.239 --> 25:21.719
I didn't make 300 by selling goods last week.

25:23.599 --> 25:25.279
I want to buy a pair of shoes for Yang Zhinan.

25:26.519 --> 25:28.359
Buy shoes for Yang Zhinan.

25:28.879 --> 25:30.519
Have you bought shoes for your father?

25:32.119 --> 25:33.239
I won't buy it for him.

25:33.239 --> 25:34.519
He scolds me all the time.

25:37.599 --> 25:40.078
Hongdou,
when does your guesthouse start to recruit?

25:40.079 --> 25:41.759
Let me work as a waiter for you.

25:42.119 --> 25:43.759
Don't be driven by impulse.

25:43.759 --> 25:46.359
When your dad planned
to close the grocery store,

25:46.359 --> 25:47.879
didn't you insist on keeping it open?

25:48.719 --> 25:50.358
I didn't want to open the store.

25:50.359 --> 25:52.078
I just didn't want to learn embroidery.

25:52.079 --> 25:53.559
I have nails under my butt.

25:53.559 --> 25:54.279
I can't sit still.

25:54.279 --> 25:56.438
With your temper,
you can't be a waitress.

25:56.439 --> 25:58.558
Why can't I with my temper?

25:58.559 --> 26:00.119
If you meet impolite guests,

26:00.119 --> 26:01.519
what should I do when you fight?

26:01.759 --> 26:03.279
I can't fight with people.

26:03.279 --> 26:05.158
I can argue with others at most.

26:05.159 --> 26:06.558
And I'm enthusiastic.

26:06.559 --> 26:07.598
I talk a lot.

26:07.599 --> 26:09.198
I can talk to anyone.

26:09.199 --> 26:11.078
Even if foreigners come,
and there's a language barrier

26:11.079 --> 26:13.679
I can also chat with them through body language.

26:14.039 --> 26:14.679
Talkative.

26:14.679 --> 26:15.758
That's right.

26:15.759 --> 26:17.198
You talk a lot, too.

26:17.199 --> 26:18.718
I am retail and you are wholesale.

26:18.719 --> 26:20.159
You are better than me.

26:21.399 --> 26:22.118
Don't make trouble.

26:22.119 --> 26:23.278
I'm calculating money.

26:23.279 --> 26:24.279
Calculating money.

26:24.559 --> 26:28.278
Well,
warm and talkative is really an advantage.

26:28.279 --> 26:29.718
Or you can think about it.

26:29.719 --> 26:32.118
If you really want to
work at our guesthouse,

26:32.119 --> 26:33.838
tell me your decision.

26:33.839 --> 26:35.918
Then we talk about salary.

26:35.919 --> 26:37.559
Come at the time of employee training.

26:37.919 --> 26:38.878
I've made my decision.

26:38.879 --> 26:39.638
I will come.

26:39.639 --> 26:41.078
Where are you going?

26:41.079 --> 26:42.119
The decoration will take several months.

26:42.119 --> 26:43.878
It will take another several months to open.

26:43.879 --> 26:46.118
During this period,
think clearly first.

26:46.119 --> 26:48.278
If you really want to come,
talk to your parents.

26:48.279 --> 26:48.919
Sell the store...

26:48.919 --> 26:49.519
I know.

26:49.519 --> 26:51.359
I'm not a three-year-old.

26:52.359 --> 26:53.038
Right.

26:53.039 --> 26:54.919
Can I take Yang Zhinan with me?

26:55.359 --> 26:56.039
No.

26:56.039 --> 26:57.598
He can work very well.

26:57.599 --> 26:59.478
You and Yang Zhinan,
I only need one.

26:59.479 --> 27:00.359
Why?

27:00.359 --> 27:01.718
Well, you know why.

27:01.719 --> 27:03.199
If you two come together,
you'd quarrel every day.

27:03.199 --> 27:04.359
Can you still work?

27:05.879 --> 27:06.919
Indeed.

27:07.159 --> 27:10.359
Besides, at that time,
I don't know if we're still together.

27:10.959 --> 27:11.998
Let me tell you.

27:11.999 --> 27:14.158
He lied to me last time
that he went home to sleep.

27:14.159 --> 27:14.999
It turned out he went to the Internet cafe

27:14.999 --> 27:16.398
and played games all night.

27:16.399 --> 27:17.678
That's too much.

27:17.679 --> 27:19.078
Then break up quickly.

27:19.079 --> 27:20.399
Why are you like that?

27:20.399 --> 27:22.278
Why don't you break up with Hongdou?

27:22.279 --> 27:23.439
We don't fight.

27:23.439 --> 27:24.759
I don't lie to her.

27:26.679 --> 27:28.358
Hongdou, let me tell you.

27:28.359 --> 27:30.638
When Uncle Yao was young,
he went swimming in the reservoir.

27:30.639 --> 27:31.958
His clothes were stolen.

27:31.959 --> 27:33.719
He went home naked.

27:36.079 --> 27:37.279
That's Yang Guanjun.

27:37.959 --> 27:39.399
Yang Guanjun?

27:41.959 --> 27:43.239
Then the one who liked to drink glycerine enema,

27:43.239 --> 27:44.239
chew the corner of the table in class,

27:44.239 --> 27:45.838
and chew a quarter
of the table corners in class.

27:45.839 --> 27:46.839
Is it you?

27:47.119 --> 27:48.759
That's Xie Qiang.

27:50.239 --> 27:51.839
Xie Qiang?

27:52.639 --> 27:53.239
Qin.

27:53.239 --> 27:53.759
Don't worry.

27:53.759 --> 27:54.518
Think carefully.

27:54.519 --> 27:56.798
Think about the embarrassing things
our Mr. Xie has done.

27:56.799 --> 27:58.159
I have plenty of time.

29:01.879 --> 29:02.959
Hu Youyu.

29:10.439 --> 29:11.599
Come in.

29:13.905 --> 29:14.985
Manjun.

29:15.839 --> 29:17.839
Why do you call me by my full name?

29:49.199 --> 29:50.479
What are you frying?

29:50.839 --> 29:51.999
It smells good.

29:52.799 --> 29:54.118
Aunt Gui taught me this.

29:54.119 --> 29:55.279
Fried mushrooms.

29:55.559 --> 29:56.439
I plan to make a few cans

29:56.439 --> 29:58.039
and send them to my daughter's school.

29:59.639 --> 30:00.919
For your daughter.

30:01.679 --> 30:02.919
Good.

30:03.879 --> 30:05.439
You've been hiding from me these days.

30:07.559 --> 30:09.159
I didn't hide from you.

30:09.159 --> 30:10.799
I'm busy.

30:11.239 --> 30:11.919
It's okay.

30:11.919 --> 30:12.919
I can understand.

30:13.599 --> 30:14.759
You feel embarrassed.

30:20.799 --> 30:22.119
That matter...

30:24.519 --> 30:26.039
How to say...

30:27.959 --> 30:31.238
I... I did drink too
much that day.

30:31.239 --> 30:32.879
I was a little impulsive.

30:33.159 --> 30:34.159
But I...

30:34.879 --> 30:37.399
Before... I dared
not think about that.

30:38.999 --> 30:40.758
You are so beautiful.

30:40.759 --> 30:41.758
Right?

30:41.759 --> 30:43.679
I dared not think that way.

30:43.999 --> 30:45.279
Besides,

30:45.639 --> 30:48.079
we all live in the yard.

30:48.599 --> 30:52.119
Well,
our relationship was very good.

30:52.399 --> 30:54.279
After that happened...

31:01.999 --> 31:03.039
Yu.

31:05.279 --> 31:06.759
I really like you.

31:10.759 --> 31:12.439
You are talented.

31:13.159 --> 31:14.878
You're kind to people around you.

31:14.879 --> 31:16.279
And you are cute.

31:16.879 --> 31:19.839
You appeared when I needed comfort most.

31:20.439 --> 31:23.999
You brought me a lot
of vitality and freshness.

31:25.159 --> 31:28.839
With you,
I really forgot many unhappy things.

31:29.919 --> 31:31.359
You were drunk that day,

31:32.039 --> 31:33.919
and took a gift to please me.

31:34.919 --> 31:38.079
It really made me flipped.

31:39.799 --> 31:41.239
But that's all.

31:41.879 --> 31:44.359
Between you and me,
there can't be more.

31:45.639 --> 31:47.199
What do you mean?

31:49.479 --> 31:50.999
I mean,

31:52.519 --> 31:54.919
I won't establish
a long-term relationship with you.

31:56.559 --> 31:58.919
Well,
then I... I don't understand.

31:59.399 --> 32:01.918
If you don't want to
establish a long-term relationship with me,

32:01.919 --> 32:02.919
you...

32:05.239 --> 32:07.439
That day, you still did that.

32:10.479 --> 32:11.439
I'm single.

32:11.439 --> 32:13.079
You're single, too.

32:14.159 --> 32:15.359
We two,

32:15.679 --> 32:17.719
under that circumstance,

32:18.319 --> 32:20.238
had a certain feeling.

32:20.239 --> 32:22.038
Willingly.

32:22.039 --> 32:23.639
So it happened.

32:30.039 --> 32:31.039
Forget it.

33:02.279 --> 33:04.158
The coffee beans are all in the storage room.

33:04.159 --> 33:06.079
Under the counter,
there are common cleaning products.

33:06.079 --> 33:07.718
Some of them are in the storage room.

33:07.719 --> 33:08.359
You should remember

33:08.359 --> 33:10.119
to check the remaining regularly every month.

33:10.119 --> 33:11.318
And then replenish them timely.

33:11.319 --> 33:12.478
And... Nana.

33:12.479 --> 33:13.519
You just go back for a while.

33:13.519 --> 33:14.678
It's not like you won't come back.

33:14.679 --> 33:16.479
There's no need to explain it in such detail.

33:16.839 --> 33:18.399
Remember?

33:18.639 --> 33:20.079
Yes.

33:21.679 --> 33:22.079
Right.

33:22.079 --> 33:23.198
And this.

33:23.199 --> 33:26.319
Here are the precautions
and the place of everything.

33:26.319 --> 33:27.719
If you don't remember
where the things are,

33:27.719 --> 33:28.879
you can check this.

33:29.279 --> 33:30.558
I'll put it here.

33:30.559 --> 33:31.238
Okay.

33:31.239 --> 33:32.519
All right, let's work.

33:39.919 --> 33:40.918
Nana.

33:40.919 --> 33:41.679
There's a handsome guy over there.

33:41.679 --> 33:42.558
He's been looking at you.

33:42.559 --> 33:43.959
Is he in love with you?

33:47.959 --> 33:49.079
Hurry to work.

33:53.799 --> 33:54.958
Hello.

33:54.959 --> 33:56.559
Yes, it's Youfeng Cafe.

33:57.199 --> 33:58.239
Singer Nana?

33:58.679 --> 33:59.479
Do you want to find Nana?

33:59.479 --> 34:00.478
Just a moment.

34:00.479 --> 34:02.038
Nana, your call.

34:02.039 --> 34:02.559
Who is it?

34:02.559 --> 34:03.159
I don't know.

34:03.159 --> 34:04.159
Just your call.

34:07.519 --> 34:08.679
Hello.

34:08.679 --> 34:09.879
Who is this, please?

34:20.959 --> 34:22.878
If it's always like last weekend,

34:22.879 --> 34:25.039
when so many people flooded in,
how nice it would be!

34:25.279 --> 34:27.879
In the evening,
people wait in line at my barbecue stand.

34:28.239 --> 34:29.839
Aren't you tired?

34:30.519 --> 34:31.959
How could making money be tiring?

34:33.039 --> 34:36.159
Mr. Dizzy next door have gone
to wholesale bubble machines.

34:36.679 --> 34:37.919
What bubble machine?

34:38.479 --> 34:39.479
That.

34:42.159 --> 34:43.279
It can spray soap bubbles automatically.

34:43.279 --> 34:43.959
The bubble machine.

34:43.959 --> 34:44.519
I know.

34:44.519 --> 34:46.039
It's a toy for children.

34:46.039 --> 34:47.039
Yeah.

34:47.919 --> 34:48.879
People in the village now

34:48.879 --> 34:51.039
want to do some small business
at their own door,

34:51.039 --> 34:52.039
selling something.

34:52.039 --> 34:52.959
That's good.

34:52.959 --> 34:53.959
Yes.

34:54.119 --> 34:55.479
Wait, someone's calling.

34:56.199 --> 34:58.278
[Unknown number]

34:58.279 --> 34:59.799
Hello, who is it?

35:00.879 --> 35:02.359
Yes, I am the manager.

35:03.759 --> 35:04.759
What?

35:05.639 --> 35:06.679
Who sings?

35:09.719 --> 35:11.198
Be polite.

35:11.199 --> 35:12.519
Are you calling the wrong number?

35:13.039 --> 35:13.359
No.

35:13.359 --> 35:14.598
Wait a minute.

35:14.599 --> 35:15.919
How do you know my phone number?

35:15.919 --> 35:16.879
Please tell me clearly.

35:16.879 --> 35:18.079
Hold on. Hey!

35:19.279 --> 35:20.799
He's insane.

35:20.799 --> 35:21.718
What?

35:21.719 --> 35:22.599
He said that in our store

35:22.599 --> 35:24.319
there's a live streamer who cheated donations.

35:24.319 --> 35:26.079
He asked me to fire her
and gave me a scolding.

35:26.079 --> 35:27.479
It's insane.

35:27.479 --> 35:29.199
It must be a fraud call.

35:29.599 --> 35:30.839
Who knows?

35:31.159 --> 35:33.039
Download the National Anti-Fraud application.

35:33.039 --> 35:34.639
I have.

35:35.319 --> 35:36.175
Look.

35:36.199 --> 35:36.519
Here we go again.

35:36.519 --> 35:37.519
Don't answer it.

35:41.639 --> 35:42.318
Sister.

35:42.319 --> 35:43.319
Bye.

35:43.559 --> 35:44.079
Yao.

35:44.079 --> 35:45.399
Remember to call me next time.

35:45.399 --> 35:46.399
No problem.

35:48.919 --> 35:49.799
A dozen people here.

35:49.799 --> 35:50.798
Go and deliver it.

35:50.799 --> 35:52.278
They can't come for some reason.

35:52.279 --> 35:53.679
Okay, I'm going.

35:54.199 --> 35:56.159
I won't bother you two here.

35:56.159 --> 35:57.279
My mother said that

35:57.279 --> 35:58.919
those who ruin good things have ill heels.

35:58.919 --> 35:59.679
I'll kick you.

35:59.679 --> 36:00.679
Goodbye.

36:01.159 --> 36:02.439
You boy.

36:08.199 --> 36:09.199
Tired?

36:11.719 --> 36:13.399
My neck and waist are a little tired.

36:14.759 --> 36:15.759
Come on.

36:15.919 --> 36:16.919
I'll give you a massage.

36:22.199 --> 36:24.479
Is the strength alright, Ms. Xu?

36:24.679 --> 36:25.999
Not bad.

36:30.559 --> 36:32.199
These days are like a fight.

36:32.719 --> 36:33.759
You must be tired.

36:36.799 --> 36:40.359
When we used to work in hotels,
during a charter,

36:40.639 --> 36:43.399
or festivals,
It's also like a fight.

36:43.959 --> 36:46.359
No wonder why everyone likes traffic.

36:46.559 --> 36:47.799
A blogger post a video.

36:47.799 --> 36:49.399
And we'd have more guests then.

36:50.239 --> 36:52.278
Before that, no one came.

36:52.279 --> 36:53.439
We were worried.

36:54.079 --> 36:55.919
There are so many people here suddenly,

36:56.319 --> 36:57.919
and we can't bear it.

36:58.919 --> 37:00.798
I read the reviews.

37:00.799 --> 37:05.519
The good ones say that
here we have enthusiasm,

37:06.239 --> 37:07.599
beautiful scenery,

37:08.319 --> 37:10.399
delicious food,
and inexpensive price.

37:10.799 --> 37:13.718
The bad ones say that
there were many people.

37:13.719 --> 37:15.519
The queue time was too long.

37:15.879 --> 37:17.038
Boring.

37:17.039 --> 37:19.518
They say there are
few interesting stores in our town.

37:19.519 --> 37:20.679
Something like that.

37:24.159 --> 37:28.959
In the future,
there will be more and more stores in town.

37:30.359 --> 37:31.799
It's bound to get better.

37:37.079 --> 37:38.598
Have you chosen the sanitary ware?

37:38.599 --> 37:39.838
Yes.

37:39.839 --> 37:43.279
I'm still going to use
high-end well-known brands.

37:45.359 --> 37:47.278
You started like this.

37:47.279 --> 37:48.679
The budget will exceed.

37:49.239 --> 37:51.158
I have considered all these.

37:51.159 --> 37:52.039
Let me tell you.

37:52.039 --> 37:55.518
I saw some other high-end guest houses.

37:55.519 --> 37:58.238
Complaints are basically
about the bathroom problem.

37:58.239 --> 37:59.879
Like the toilet is blocked.

38:00.079 --> 38:01.558
The sewer smells bad.

38:01.559 --> 38:03.438
The shower head is not big enough.

38:03.439 --> 38:04.878
The water temperature is unstable.

38:04.879 --> 38:06.758
So I decided to do it once and for all.

38:06.759 --> 38:08.878
The brand of sanitary wares must be the best.

38:08.879 --> 38:11.518
It saves the subsequent maintenance costs.

38:11.519 --> 38:14.559
Then it can also greatly
improve the brand experience.

38:15.679 --> 38:16.679
Right?

38:17.519 --> 38:21.159
Then,
the bedding and mattress should also be fine.

38:22.679 --> 38:26.039
Those bath towels,
face towels, and all these

38:26.039 --> 38:27.358
should be the best.

38:27.359 --> 38:30.879
These are all key points
to promote customer experience.

38:33.039 --> 38:35.719
For toiletries,
I prepare to use a domestic brand.

38:35.719 --> 38:37.599
I've found a good one.

38:39.959 --> 38:41.039
What about the furniture?

38:41.319 --> 38:42.558
The furniture.

38:42.559 --> 38:43.599
Same style.

38:43.599 --> 38:44.519
Different wood.

38:44.519 --> 38:46.078
That's a big difference.

38:46.079 --> 38:46.719
Let me tell you.

38:46.719 --> 38:49.919
Like cherry and beech,
they are cheap.

38:50.159 --> 38:51.838
Walnut and teak are expensive.

38:51.839 --> 38:52.519
Let me tell you.

38:52.519 --> 38:54.358
The price can be several times higher.

38:54.359 --> 38:56.358
So I think for the wood,

38:56.359 --> 38:58.198
we can use something a little cheaper.

38:58.199 --> 38:59.759
But it doesn't affect the texture.

39:01.279 --> 39:03.198
You think clearly.

39:03.199 --> 39:04.559
You have a general view.

39:05.119 --> 39:07.678
This steel should be used on the blade.

39:07.679 --> 39:08.479
Some money can be saved.

39:08.479 --> 39:09.639
Some money can't be saved.

39:09.639 --> 39:10.478
Is it?

39:10.479 --> 39:11.118
You think.

39:11.119 --> 39:14.279
Guests in high-end
guesthouses must be very picky.

39:14.519 --> 39:16.599
The details will make or break.

39:18.399 --> 39:22.198
I thought that in entrepreneurship,
I'm your senior.

39:22.199 --> 39:23.679
I can teach you many things.

39:23.879 --> 39:26.679
Now it seems that you
don't need me to teach you.

39:27.479 --> 39:28.319
No.

39:28.319 --> 39:29.838
This is just the beginning.

39:29.839 --> 39:31.839
There must be many
problems later I need to ask you.

39:31.839 --> 39:33.159
Don't see me as annoying.

39:33.559 --> 39:34.678
Annoying?

39:34.679 --> 39:36.559
I'm afraid you don't need me.

39:37.639 --> 39:40.439
The construction team
you found is especially good.

39:41.679 --> 39:45.439
The leader in charge of
construction is very responsible.

39:45.799 --> 39:48.159
Would I find someone bad for you?

39:50.839 --> 39:51.239
Come here.

39:51.239 --> 39:52.239
I'll give you a message.

39:52.399 --> 39:53.558
I'm fine.

39:53.559 --> 39:54.678
It's okay. Come on.

39:54.679 --> 39:55.679
Alright.

40:14.359 --> 40:21.719
[Nana's rumors]

40:43.919 --> 40:46.239
[Nana is innocent. No one hears the truth.]

40:51.119 --> 40:53.119
[Complaint]

40:53.119 --> 40:54.719
[False information
Spreading rumors]

40:59.479 --> 41:01.799
[Submit]

41:16.599 --> 41:17.759
Hello, Damai.

41:19.559 --> 41:21.079
Nana is at work.

41:24.759 --> 41:25.759
What's the matter?

41:26.759 --> 41:27.319
What?

41:27.319 --> 41:28.839
I don't quite understand what you mean.

41:40.079 --> 41:40.918
Nana.

41:40.919 --> 41:42.399
Have you finished packing?

41:43.719 --> 41:44.959
Hongdou.

41:46.119 --> 41:47.439
It will be ready soon.

41:47.679 --> 41:49.679
Are you going to the construction site today?

41:49.879 --> 41:51.039
I will go later.

41:55.719 --> 41:57.079
How long will you go back?

41:59.599 --> 42:02.759
I haven't been home for a long time.

42:03.399 --> 42:04.358
Then...

42:04.359 --> 42:05.559
Will you come back?

42:11.719 --> 42:13.079
This time, after you leave,

42:13.279 --> 42:14.598
where are you going?

42:14.599 --> 42:15.719
Back to Shanghai?

42:23.279 --> 42:24.279
You...

42:25.759 --> 42:27.079
You've known it?

